'Expected temporary immunity to bullets, explosions, fire, and fall damage.',
'Not yet confirmed in initial PowerPyx / press 61-cheat unlock pools; queued for post-story verification.',
2, 'coming_soon', 0, 20, '2026-11-18 19:30:00', 'v1.00',
